<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CBRP> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CBRP-CBRT_TESN-type> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CBRP> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> <https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CBRP-CBRT_TESN> .
