<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CORE-CORE_DURN-format> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CORE-CORE_DURN-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "CORE_DURN: value is not in the suggested format T (elapsed time, e.g. hh:mm:ss). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CORE-CORE_DURN-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/CORE_DURN> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CORE-CORE_DURN-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^(P.+|[0-9]+(:[0-5][0-9]){1,2}(\\.[0-9]+)?)$" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CORE-CORE_DURN-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CORE-CORE_DURN-type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CORE-CORE_DURN-type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "CORE_DURN: value is not of the suggested type T (a duration or time or string). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
