<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPDT-CPDG_DPTH-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "CPDG_DPTH: value is not in the suggested format 2DP (2 decimal places). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPDT-CPDG_DPTH-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/CPDG_DPTH> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPDT-CPDG_DPTH-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[+-]?[0-9]+\\.[0-9]{2}$" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPDT-CPDG_DPTH-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
