<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CPTG-CPTG_APCL-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "CPTG_APCL: value is not a standard AGS 4.2.0 abbreviation for CPTG_APCL. Non-standard values must be defined in the file (Rule 16)." .
