<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CTRC-CTRC_ASE-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "CTRC_ASE: value is not in the suggested format 1DP (1 decimal place). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CTRC-CTRC_ASE-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/CTRC_ASE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CTRC-CTRC_ASE-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^[+-]?[0-9]+\\.[0-9]{1}$" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/CTRC-CTRC_ASE-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
