<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DICT-DICT_DTYP-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "DICT_DTYP: value is not a standard AGS 4.2.0 data type. Non-standard values must be defined in the file (Rule 17)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/DICT-DICT_DTYP-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/DICT_DTYP> .
