<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/FGHS-LOCA_ID-type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "LOCA_ID: value is not of the suggested type ID (text). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/FGHS-LOCA_ID-type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/LOCA_ID> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/FGHS-LOCA_ID-type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/FGHS-LOCA_ID> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/FGHS-LOCA_ID> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "327-16A" .
