<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/FLSH-LOCA_ID-type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "LOCA_ID: value is not of the suggested type ID (text). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
