<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/FLSH-parent> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "The LOCA (Location Details) record this FLSH record belongs to (Rule 10c)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/FLSH-parent> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
