<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/GRAG-GRAG_CLAY-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "GRAG_CLAY: value is not in the suggested format 1DP (1 decimal place). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/GRAG-GRAG_CLAY-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/GRAG_CLAY> .
