<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/LSTG-parent> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name> "parent" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/LSTG-parent> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/parent> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/LSTG-parent> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/rule> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules/rule-10c> .
