<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PMTD-PMTG_TESN> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/PMTG_TESN> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PMTD-PMTG_TESN> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dataType> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/data-types/X> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/PMTD-PMTG_TESN> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dictionaryEntry> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/PMTG_TESN> .
