<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/RCCV-RCCV_100-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "RCCV_100: value is not in the suggested format 0DP (0 decimal places). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
