<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/RDEN-TEST_STAT> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/RDEN-TEST_STAT> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#order> "21"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/RDEN-TEST_STAT> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/TEST_STAT> .
