<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/RESG-key-null> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Another RESG record has the same combination of KEY fields (LOCA_ID, SAMP_TOP, SAMP_REF, SAMP_TYPE, SAMP_ID, SPEC_REF, SPEC_DPTH): {?xother} (Rule 10a)" .
