<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/SCPP-SCPP_TOP-format> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "SCPP_TOP: value is not in the suggested format 2DP (2 decimal places). This is allowed if the file's TYPE row declares another type (Rule 8)." .
