<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/SCPP-SCPP_TOP> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/dictionaryEntry> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/SCPP_TOP> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/SCPP-SCPP_TOP> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/headingStatus> "*" .
