<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/SHBT-SPEC_REF> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/headingStatus> "*" .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/SHBT-SPEC_REF> <https://w3id.org/ags4/ont/isKey> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
