<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/TREG-TREG_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/TREG-TREG_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "TREG_TYPE: value is not a standard AGS 4.2.0 abbreviation for TREG_TYPE. Non-standard values must be defined in the file (Rule 16)." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/TREG-TREG_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/ags4/def/TREG_TYPE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/shapes/TREG-TREG_TYPE-codes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^(CIUCM|CADC|CADE|CAUC|CAUE|CIDC|CIDE|CIUC|CDM|CUM|UUP|CD|CU)(\\+(CIUCM|CADC|CADE|CAUC|CAUE|CIDC|CIDE|CIUC|CDM|CUM|UUP|CD|CU))*$" .
