<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/CORE> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "CORE is used to transfer details of rotary coring in rock and soil materials.\nThe data transferred for coring in rock will be more extensive than for soil coring; specifically the SCR and RQD are not determined for soil cores.\nCORE_DURN permits the inclusion of the time duration for the core run to be drilled if this is a specified additional measured parameter."@en .
