<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "DICT"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "User Defined Groups and Headings"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote> "Group status: Required in all files which include user defined groups and/or headings (Rule 18)\nAGS 4.1: Group Rule Added - • If the DICT_TYPE is HEADING, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP, DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_UNIT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_DESC. • If the DICT_TYPE is GROUP, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP and DICT_DESC and the DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_UNIT headings shall contain NULL values. • Data type for data field heading DICT_UNIT shall not be changed from PU." .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_DESC> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_DTYP> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_EXMP> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_GRP> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_HDNG> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_PGRP> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_REM> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_STAT> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_TYPE> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_UNIT> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FILE_FSET> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "DICT"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "User Defined Groups and Headings"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "DICT is required in all AGS4 files where user defined groups and/or headings are specified (Rule 18).\nDICT_STAT defines the status of the heading. This shall contain the data 'KEY', 'REQUIRED', 'KEY+REQUIRED' or 'OTHER', where OTHER denotes the data field is neither key nor required (Rule 10).\nDICT_PGRP allows for inclusion of the parent group name when the DICT_TYPE is \"GROUP\". This permits data integrity checking where data files include user defined groups."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Group rules: If the DICT_TYPE is HEADING, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP, DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_UNIT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_DESC.\nIf the DICT_TYPE is GROUP, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP and DICT_DESC and the DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_UNIT headings shall contain NULL values.\nData type for data field heading DICT_UNIT shall not be changed from PU."@en .
