<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DMTG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "DMTG is used to record the general information about flat dilatometer tests.\nDMTG_WATA is required to clarify the origin of water level recorded in DMTG_WAT.\nFlat dilatometer testing is frequently carried out by specialist sub-contractors. DMTG_CONT is included to record the name of the specialist sub-contractor."@en .
