<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DMTP> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The DMTP group is used to transfer derived parameters determined from flat dilatometer tests.\nThe requirement for this information as part of ground investigation reporting shall be fully specified at the outset of the investigation. The specification may need to detail the interpretative method(s) to be used.\nHeadings with suffix of M are intended for details of the correlation methods/references used to carry out calculations."@en .
