<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/ICBR> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "ICBR_TYPE allows a description or abbreviation to be included to categorise the equipment and method of measurement.\nICBR_SEAT allows the plunger seating force to be included in the data as required.\nICBR_SURC allows the surcharge pressure to be recorded and the description for the ICBR_REM heading has been modified.\nICBR_CONT allows the name of a specialist sub-contracting organization to be credited with the testing."@en .
