<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/IFID> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Group rules: IFID_RES shall generally be numeric data. A text form shall only be used by addition of a prefixing operator to denote greater than or less than conditions i.e. >200 when readings are above the reporting limit of the testing equipment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/IFID> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "IFID is used to record the results of on-site volatile testing by means of headspace analysis using flame ionisation detectors.\nIFID_CRED added to permit details of any test accreditation if appropriate to be included in data."@en .
