<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/IPID> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote> "AGS 4.1: Group Rule Added - • IPID_RES should generally be numeric data. A text form shall only be used by addition of a prefixing operator to denote greater than or less than conditions i.e. >200 when readings are above the reporting limit of the testing equipment." .
