<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/LBSG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The LBSG group is used to describe the testing schedules generated on a project.\nOne data row in this group represents the issue of one schedule to a laboratory or testing organization.\nAny general requirements for the test schedule, for example, dates for completion, contact details, should be included in this group. Details of the test required are provided in the LBST group against the samples."@en .
