<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/LDYN> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "LDYN is to be used to report dynamic testing on soil and rock materials.\nThe measurements of bulk density, dry density, water/moisture content, porosity and saturation that described the test specimen condition related to these tests should be recorded in RDEN."@en .
