<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/LRES> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The water conductivity LRES_WCND may be included from relevant testing. For tests with natural water content values may come from suitable water collected in boreholes or, where water is added, a combination of in situ values and those of the added water.\nThe method used including the container shape (LRES_CSHP) and test geometry (LRES_PENT) should be included."@en .
