<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/MONS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "MONS is used to transfer the status of a monitoring installation and instrument at a given time, or time period.\nMONS_RPLO and MONS_RPID are available to record which MONG record has been replaced by this current record, for example when an instrument is damaged and replace with a new one. A new instrument would typically correspond to a new MONG record."@en .
