<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/PIPE> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "PIPE is to be used to transfer pipe work lengths installed in an exploratory hole to provide instrumentation access.\nA data row is included for each pipe length/type/diameter combination in a hole.\nPIPE_TYPE would typically define the graphics used to represent the installation pipe work on reports or diagrams."@en .
