<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/PLTG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "PLTG is to be used to transfer plate load tests. One data row in this group represents a test and loading cycle.\nThe Factors a0, a1 and a2 are determined in testing carried out to the DIN standard and would not be appropriate for testing to other standards.\nPLTG_EV2 is normally only completed when PLTG_CYC = 2."@en .
