<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules/rule-12> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules/rule-12> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules/rule-12> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Data does not have to be included against each HEADING unless REQUIRED (Rule 10b). The data FIELD can be null; a null entry is defined as \"\" (two quotes together)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules/rule-12> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules/rule-12> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token> .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules/rule-12> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Rule 12"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules/rule-12> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/rules> .
